('nanaji-krishi-sanjivani','Nanaji Deshmukh Krishi Sanjivani Yojana','नानाजी देशमुख कृषी संजीवनी योजना','नानाजी देशमुख कृषि संजीवनी योजना','state','Maharashtra',
 'Maharashtra programme for climate-resilient agriculture, soil and water conservation and livelihood support in selected villages.',
 'Interventions vary by village plan and may include water conservation, soil health, crop diversification and livestock support. Confirm the current village list and components with the district agriculture office.',
 array['Farmer in a selected project village','Small/marginal farmer priority as per current guidelines','Selection through the village-level project process'],
 array['Aadhaar card','Land records','Bank passbook','Village/farmer registration details'],
 'https://krishi.maharashtra.gov.in/','Department of Agriculture, Government of Maharashtra',current_date),
('maharashtra-interest-subvention','Maharashtra farmer crop-loan interest subvention','महाराष्ट्र शेतकरी पीक कर्ज व्याज अनुदान','महाराष्ट्र किसान फसल ऋण ब्याज अनुदान','state','Maharashtra',
 'State support for interest relief on eligible crop loans, implemented through participating banks and MahaDBT.',
